                                                "sense_id": "96dc807d-2173-3db3-a86f-90123de72a26",
                                                "text": "Williams was co-hosting in place of Katie Couric, a move some have speculated was meant to deprive the possible next anchoress of the CBS Evening News the prime time exposure."
